OL,3,AStrictly returns with new hosting trio
OL,4,Aas celebrities find out dance pairings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fresh cohort of famous faces `
OL,7,Fincluding actress Melanie Walters and
OL,8,Fformer England footballer Shaun
OL,9,FWright-Phillips ` also stepped onto the
OL,10,Fballroom floor for the first time.
OL,12,FDuring the launch show, it was revealed
OL,13,Fwhich professional dancers they were
OL,14,Fpaired with.
